1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Princess Knight,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Seventh Episode
The Swan

15
00:02:09,021 --> 00:02:10,818
Hey, Garigori!

16
00:02:14,821 --> 00:02:17,335
Hello, chamberlain! I'm coming!

17
00:02:19,741 --> 00:02:22,699
Greetings, great keeper of time!
How's it going?

18
00:02:22,821 --> 00:02:24,812
Bad, damn it!

19
00:02:27,461 --> 00:02:29,656
Why are you so nervous, Garigori?

20
00:02:30,141 --> 00:02:32,371
Because my only daughter Mary
has disappeared!

21
00:02:32,421 --> 00:02:34,412
What can I do? Poor me!

22
00:02:34,821 --> 00:02:38,097
- Mary has disappeared?!
- She's nowhere to be found! Poor Mary!

23
00:03:33,141 --> 00:03:34,654
Good!

24
00:03:45,661 --> 00:03:47,777
We evil spirits
wish Hecate...

25
00:03:47,821 --> 00:03:49,891
...a very happy birthday!

26
00:03:52,901 --> 00:04:00,901
Happy birthday to you,
happy birthday to you,

27
00:04:02,181 --> 00:04:10,181
happy birthday to Hecate,
happy birthday to you!

28
00:04:10,901 --> 00:04:12,812
Many thanks, friends!

29
00:04:13,141 --> 00:04:16,656
- Do you have presents for her?
- Of course!

30
00:04:29,861 --> 00:04:31,738
A face lotion,

31
00:04:31,781 --> 00:04:34,136
made with the blood
of snake and lizard.

32
00:04:34,421 --> 00:04:36,616
Yes, my lord!
If your daughter Hecate...

33
00:04:36,661 --> 00:04:38,811
...rubs her face
with it every day,

34
00:04:38,861 --> 00:04:40,852
she will become meaner
and prettier.

35
00:04:40,901 --> 00:04:42,857
An elixir of vulture tears...

36
00:04:42,901 --> 00:04:45,131
...in the horn of a goat
blind in one eye.

37
00:04:45,181 --> 00:04:47,570
- Is this yours?
- Yes! One drop in her eyes...

38
00:04:47,621 --> 00:04:49,691
...will give her sight
so sharp...

39
00:04:49,741 --> 00:04:51,811
...who will read
the minds of men!

40
00:04:51,861 --> 00:04:55,058
Idiots!
Take back your trash!

41
00:04:58,021 --> 00:05:00,012
For my daughter
I only want one thing:

42
00:05:00,061 --> 00:05:03,610
a heart that will make her become
a good... witch!

43
00:05:03,661 --> 00:05:06,016
- Sapphire's blue one?
- Exactly!

44
00:05:06,061 --> 00:05:08,529
Prince Sapphire,
even though she is a girl,

45
00:05:08,581 --> 00:05:10,617
also has the heart of a boy!

46
00:05:10,661 --> 00:05:14,370
When I take that heart away from her and
transplant it into Hecate's chest,

47
00:05:14,421 --> 00:05:16,651
I will make my daughter
a great witch!

48
00:05:16,701 --> 00:05:18,453
You, swan!

49
00:05:28,381 --> 00:05:31,418
Will this be the animal
that will bring me Prince Sapphire!

50
00:05:31,461 --> 00:05:34,021
Go to Earth, cursed swan!

51
00:06:06,341 --> 00:06:08,855
So, tell me: have you found Mary?

52
00:06:08,901 --> 00:06:10,732
Still no trace, Your Highness.

53
00:06:10,781 --> 00:06:13,090
Then go back to scour the kingdom
in search of her!

54
00:06:13,140 --> 00:06:15,018
Yes, Your Highness!

55
00:06:22,700 --> 00:06:24,498
I hear a strange sound...!

56
00:06:30,020 --> 00:06:33,457
It's a swan! It seems injured

57
00:06:37,620 --> 00:06:40,419
Don't be afraid,
I don't want to hurt you.

58
00:06:40,900 --> 00:06:42,892
No, don't run away!

59
00:06:52,420 --> 00:06:55,811
Garigori! Catch that swan
that fell behind you!

60
00:06:55,860 --> 00:06:58,659
What?! How do you expect me
to start thinking about a swan...

61
00:06:58,700 --> 00:07:00,851
...with all the worries
that I have?!

62
00:07:01,540 --> 00:07:03,259
But Garigori!

63
00:07:06,420 --> 00:07:09,572
I'm afraid its wound will
get worse if it keeps flying!

64
00:07:15,700 --> 00:07:18,010
Don't be afraid, I'll take care of it!

65
00:07:27,340 --> 00:07:29,059
Gotcha!

66
00:07:35,300 --> 00:07:37,735
Come! I'll nurse you back to
health, beautiful little swan!

67
00:07:38,900 --> 00:07:40,619
Sapphire!

68
00:07:40,660 --> 00:07:42,538
I thought
someone was calling me!

69
00:07:42,580 --> 00:07:45,254
- I'm here!
- Ah, it's you, Tink!

70
00:07:45,700 --> 00:07:47,692
What happened to that swan?

71
00:07:47,740 --> 00:07:49,732
It's injured
and I caught it to treat it.

72
00:07:49,780 --> 00:07:52,375
No! Sapphire, let go of
that swan! Leave it alone!

73
00:07:52,420 --> 00:07:55,015
- And why is that?
- Because it is not a normal swan.

74
00:07:55,060 --> 00:07:57,416
I feel that that animal
comes from the devil's court.

75
00:07:57,460 --> 00:07:59,497
- The devil?!
- Yes, but I will break the spell.

76
00:07:59,540 --> 00:08:01,418
...with my angel feather.

77
00:08:02,100 --> 00:08:04,012
There! Did you see?

78
00:08:08,820 --> 00:08:11,540
Is it true that you are
not a normal swan?

79
00:08:14,820 --> 00:08:17,016
Look, it is trying to
tell me something.

80
00:08:17,060 --> 00:08:19,097
It seems it wants to ask for help!

81
00:08:21,060 --> 00:08:24,895
It says it is a girl kidnapped by
Mephisto and transformed into a swan.

82
00:08:24,940 --> 00:08:29,014
Perhaps I know who you are! You
are Mary, Garigori's daughter, right?

83
00:08:29,220 --> 00:08:32,657
Now this is a surprise! That is
why Mary is nowhere to be found!

84
00:08:32,700 --> 00:08:35,932
We should inform Garigori of
what happened to his daughter.

85
00:08:35,980 --> 00:08:41,374
Mary! Mary! My poor
daughter! Where did you go?

86
00:08:48,621 --> 00:08:51,010
Garigori, we have
found your daughter!

87
00:08:51,741 --> 00:08:54,380
- Really? And where is she?
- Right before your eyes!

88
00:08:54,421 --> 00:08:56,491
She was transformed
into a swan by Mephisto!

89
00:09:01,141 --> 00:09:05,737
My daughter! Dear Mary,
what happened to you?

90
00:09:05,781 --> 00:09:08,579
My poor daughter! What
have they done to you?!

91
00:09:08,621 --> 00:09:11,215
You were the
consolation of my life!

92
00:09:11,261 --> 00:09:15,891
Poor, little dear! Mary! Mary!

93
00:09:24,621 --> 00:09:27,419
- Did you hear?
- Opal, little horse, come here!

94
00:09:27,461 --> 00:09:29,611
- No!
- Leave me alone! I will teach Mephisto a lesson!

95
00:09:29,661 --> 00:09:31,652
But don't you understand?!
This is one of his traps!

96
00:09:31,701 --> 00:09:34,659
Mary, speak, my little
girl! Tell me something!

97
00:09:34,701 --> 00:09:36,896
Opal! Opal!

98
00:09:36,941 --> 00:09:38,818
Listen, Opal...

99
00:09:41,021 --> 00:09:44,809
Opal! Go, Opal! To the
field of the black lily!

100
00:09:47,101 --> 00:09:50,730
Hey! Hey, Opal!
Where are you going? Stop!

101
00:09:50,781 --> 00:09:54,569
You are going in the wrong
direction! You have to go the other way!

102
00:09:54,621 --> 00:09:57,135
Stop! Opal!

103
00:09:57,181 --> 00:09:59,137
But where could he be taking me?

104
00:10:08,221 --> 00:10:10,735
What happened to me? Where am I?

105
00:10:12,501 --> 00:10:15,413
I'm sorry, Sapphire, I
was forced to tie you up.

106
00:10:15,461 --> 00:10:18,100
- I didn't want you to go.
- How dare you stand in my way?

107
00:10:18,141 --> 00:10:20,018
I will never forgive you!

108
00:10:20,421 --> 00:10:23,538
You will stay in this little church
until I have driven out Mephisto.

109
00:10:23,581 --> 00:10:26,334
Here you are safe, because
the devil will be afraid to enter.

110
00:10:26,381 --> 00:10:29,737
You can't do such a thing! You
won't be able to defeat Mephisto!

111
00:10:29,781 --> 00:10:32,659
Yes I can! You forget that
I have an angel's feather.

112
00:10:32,701 --> 00:10:35,499
- Let me come with you, Tink!
- No way!

113
00:10:36,461 --> 00:10:39,453
- My poor daughter is dead!
- What?!

114
00:10:39,861 --> 00:10:42,534
Her body is already cold!

115
00:10:43,661 --> 00:10:45,891
My feather will restore her to life.

116
00:10:46,341 --> 00:10:49,538
- It's useless!
- Why didn't it work?

117
00:10:49,581 --> 00:10:51,697
Mephisto has taken Mary back!

118
00:10:51,741 --> 00:10:54,380
He has imprisoned her
soul in a magic sphere.

119
00:10:54,421 --> 00:10:58,096
To get her back, that sphere must
be exposed to the morning light.

120
00:10:58,141 --> 00:11:01,895
Untie me and I will get that
sphere! Damn it, he's already gone!

121
00:11:01,941 --> 00:11:05,092
Come back, Tink! Wait!

122
00:11:12,901 --> 00:11:16,257
What is happening?
Help! The roof is collapsing!

123
00:11:19,421 --> 00:11:22,333
- Where did His Highness go?
- Opal!

124
00:11:27,901 --> 00:11:31,814
I bet it's Sapphire...!
Stop, Sapphire! Don't go!

125
00:11:32,381 --> 00:11:37,011
Mephisto is doing this on purpose to
make you fall into a trap! You mustn't!

126
00:11:39,261 --> 00:11:41,252
Get out of the way or you'll be trampled!

127
00:11:43,101 --> 00:11:44,853
You asked for it!

128
00:11:47,461 --> 00:11:51,010
Know that the Prince of
Silverland is not afraid of any devil.

129
00:11:51,061 --> 00:11:53,097
And now excuse me,
but I'll take your feather.

130
00:11:53,341 --> 00:11:57,380
You're doing a foolish thing! What
will happen if Mephisto captures you?

131
00:11:57,421 --> 00:11:59,696
Silverland will fall into the
hands of the evil bandits...

132
00:11:59,741 --> 00:12:01,891
...should you be killed!

133
00:12:09,021 --> 00:12:12,138
Well, well!
My plan is succeeding!

134
00:12:12,861 --> 00:12:14,817
Are you happy, Hecate?

135
00:12:14,861 --> 00:12:16,852
Sapphire is falling into my net!

136
00:12:16,901 --> 00:12:19,495
I can't bring myself to
be happy. I don't feel well.

137
00:12:19,541 --> 00:12:21,452
Are you really not feeling well?

138
00:12:21,501 --> 00:12:24,459
Then you can take a little
poison, or... Oh, I've got it!

139
00:12:25,061 --> 00:12:27,211
The devils! Damn it!

140
00:12:27,461 --> 00:12:31,340
Look at them there! They are
all drunk! Now I'll handle this!

141
00:12:34,221 --> 00:12:36,018
Dance!

142
00:12:55,261 --> 00:12:58,094
Sapphire wants to fight Mephisto
alone, but he won't make it!

143
00:12:58,141 --> 00:13:00,132
The devil is far
stronger than him!

144
00:13:00,181 --> 00:13:03,571
I must try to free
myself so I can help him!

145
00:13:03,901 --> 00:13:06,017
You'll have to deal with me, Mephisto!

146
00:13:16,541 --> 00:13:18,452
It's fantastic!

147
00:14:10,821 --> 00:14:12,493
Come!

148
00:14:21,301 --> 00:14:25,294
My little Hecate, do you know that
you are about to become a great witch?

149
00:14:25,341 --> 00:14:28,060
You don't need to worry, I
will always be close to you!

150
00:14:28,101 --> 00:14:31,332
You'll see, I will make you happy!
For you I would do anything!

151
00:14:31,381 --> 00:14:33,736
I would even fight
against Heaven!

152
00:14:33,781 --> 00:14:37,217
But if you did that, the Lord would
turn you to ashes as punishment!

153
00:14:37,261 --> 00:14:39,456
I wouldn't care about
being turned to ashes...

154
00:14:39,501 --> 00:14:41,298
...for my dear, little Hecate!

155
00:14:41,461 --> 00:14:43,213
Dad!

156
00:14:58,461 --> 00:15:02,613
So hot...! That crater is
the entrance to Mephisto's lair.

157
00:15:04,821 --> 00:15:07,016
Are you feeling better
now that you've had fun?

158
00:15:07,061 --> 00:15:10,337
Yes! It had been a long
time since I had this much fun!

159
00:15:10,741 --> 00:15:13,175
Hail, Mephisto!

160
00:15:13,661 --> 00:15:16,459
I'm sure you'll like
it! Open the box!

161
00:15:17,461 --> 00:15:21,454
I wonder what's there...!
Oh, what a beautiful cake!

162
00:15:21,901 --> 00:15:27,214
Happy birthday to you,
happy birthday to you!

163
00:15:28,541 --> 00:15:32,250
I'm so happy! So, let's hear:
how old are you today, Hecate?

164
00:15:32,301 --> 00:15:36,135
- 13, Dad!
- Devils, I need 13 candles!

165
00:15:36,821 --> 00:15:39,096
How wonderful, Dad!

166
00:15:39,141 --> 00:15:41,814
Come on, blow out the
candles, daughter! Blow!

167
00:15:44,421 --> 00:15:48,334
No! No! Why don't you put
out the fire with your magic?

168
00:15:48,701 --> 00:15:50,532
Hail Mephisto!

169
00:15:52,661 --> 00:15:56,415
The hellfire is too strong
for this little breeze.

170
00:15:56,461 --> 00:15:58,019
Hail Mephisto!

171
00:15:58,061 --> 00:16:00,416
Eat the fire of the candles
for me, fire-eating bird!

172
00:16:04,021 --> 00:16:06,535
You're not there yet! Give it your all!

173
00:16:06,581 --> 00:16:08,731
I want rain! Hail Mephisto!

174
00:16:09,301 --> 00:16:12,099
It seems a bit too little to
put out a fire, don't you think?

175
00:16:12,141 --> 00:16:14,018
Downpour!

176
00:16:15,261 --> 00:16:18,014
Now it's too much! The
birthday cake will melt!

177
00:16:18,061 --> 00:16:20,097
Poor me,
I can't do anything right!

178
00:16:20,141 --> 00:16:22,735
Come on, come on,
daughter! It's not that bad.

179
00:16:23,141 --> 00:16:26,213
I know anyway that
everything I do is done badly!

180
00:16:27,301 --> 00:16:29,895
Don't be discouraged,
daughter, but keep trying...

181
00:16:29,941 --> 00:16:31,932
...until things
go well for you!

182
00:16:36,101 --> 00:16:39,138
Hey, Mephisto!
I smell a human!

183
00:16:39,181 --> 00:16:42,139
Really?
Yeah, seems like it to me too

184
00:16:42,181 --> 00:16:45,332
This means that Sapphire
has finally arrived!

185
00:16:45,381 --> 00:16:47,258
Get ready, Hecate!

186
00:16:50,141 --> 00:16:53,133
Go Mephisto!

187
00:16:58,021 --> 00:17:00,137
You're trapped now, Sapphire!

188
00:17:00,461 --> 00:17:02,611
I want to stay as I am, Dad!

189
00:17:02,661 --> 00:17:05,221
I don't want you to
give me Sapphire's heart!

190
00:17:05,261 --> 00:17:07,650
- Please, Dad!
- Don't be foolish!

191
00:17:07,701 --> 00:17:11,330
- Lie down here for the operation!
- No, Dad! I don't want to!

192
00:17:14,021 --> 00:17:16,819
Now it's between us,
Prince! You won't escape!

193
00:17:17,141 --> 00:17:21,134
But where is he? He was
just here! I know he was here!

194
00:17:28,581 --> 00:17:30,572
Watch out!

195
00:17:31,101 --> 00:17:33,012
This is an angel's feather!

196
00:17:39,301 --> 00:17:41,292
Damn you!

197
00:17:47,381 --> 00:17:49,815
- I'm taking the magic sphere!
- No!

198
00:17:50,501 --> 00:17:53,493
- I want it, Mephisto!
- You'll have to fight for it!

199
00:17:57,621 --> 00:17:59,339
Come, Hecate!

200
00:17:59,781 --> 00:18:01,578
No, she stays here!

201
00:18:02,021 --> 00:18:05,093
Move, Hecate! Damn Sapphire,
what do you intend to do?

202
00:18:05,141 --> 00:18:07,018
If you hurt her, I will kill you!

203
00:18:07,061 --> 00:18:10,053
I will send your daughter up there
only if you give me the magic sphere!

204
00:18:16,501 --> 00:18:19,015
- How dare you?
- Look, I have the feather!

205
00:18:19,061 --> 00:18:21,529
- You'd better make a deal!
- Damn that feather!

206
00:18:21,581 --> 00:18:24,539
Alright, I'll accept the exchange! But
aren't you ashamed of blackmailing me?

207
00:18:24,581 --> 00:18:28,051
What are you babbling about, Mephisto?
You should be ashamed, rather,

208
00:18:28,101 --> 00:18:30,535
for having transformed
sweet Mary into a swan!

209
00:18:30,581 --> 00:18:32,492
Alright, you won this time!

210
00:18:32,541 --> 00:18:35,453
Damn the feather!
Take the magic sphere!

211
00:18:41,701 --> 00:18:43,532
Good!

212
00:18:55,861 --> 00:18:58,659
Faster, friends! Hurry up!

213
00:19:07,581 --> 00:19:09,219
Damn this tooth!

214
00:19:11,301 --> 00:19:13,019
Damn it!

215
00:19:17,301 --> 00:19:19,610
- Woodpecker, can you give me a hand?
- I'm coming!

216
00:19:23,661 --> 00:19:25,538
Thank you, you were very kind!

217
00:19:25,581 --> 00:19:28,493
Don't mention it, it was a pleasure!
And besides, I'm crazy about the rope!

218
00:19:30,901 --> 00:19:33,859
I wasn't calling you, but some
bird to get a ride.

219
00:19:33,901 --> 00:19:36,813
What do you mean? That I'm not
strong enough to give you a lift?

220
00:19:36,861 --> 00:19:39,659
Well, even though I'm small,
I think I weigh enough for you.

221
00:19:39,701 --> 00:19:41,532
No nonsense! Hang on!

222
00:19:41,661 --> 00:19:44,494
Wow! I didn't think
you were so strong!

223
00:20:26,461 --> 00:20:30,215
The feather! Whirlwind,
blow that feather away!

224
00:20:32,421 --> 00:20:35,015
Now Sapphire
will no longer be able to resist me!

225
00:20:35,141 --> 00:20:37,291
Hecate! Hecate!

226
00:20:39,421 --> 00:20:41,412
Hecate, where are you?

227
00:20:43,301 --> 00:20:45,531
Let me hide among you.

228
00:20:53,021 --> 00:20:55,012
Hecate, where have you hidden?

229
00:20:55,901 --> 00:20:59,371
You can't fool me! I see that there
is one swan too many among you.

230
00:20:59,541 --> 00:21:02,009
Hecate, I know you have
transformed into a swan!

231
00:21:02,061 --> 00:21:04,416
Turn back to normal
and don't make me angry!

232
00:21:04,821 --> 00:21:06,812
No, dad! I don't want to!

233
00:21:06,861 --> 00:21:09,614
Don't be foolish and remember
that you are the daughter of Mephisto!

234
00:21:09,661 --> 00:21:12,653
I thought you cared about
making me happy, dad.

235
00:21:12,701 --> 00:21:14,419
Too bad for you!

236
00:21:15,621 --> 00:21:18,135
No, let go of me, dad!
I don't want to! Please!

237
00:21:19,101 --> 00:21:21,012
Get over there!

238
00:21:22,701 --> 00:21:25,215
What?! Is dawn already breaking?

239
00:21:25,261 --> 00:21:27,695
Damn it! How time has flown
tonight!

240
00:21:27,781 --> 00:21:29,817
Come on, try again!

241
00:21:32,661 --> 00:21:35,573
I'm a bit hoarse,
I can't do it.

242
00:21:37,021 --> 00:21:39,330
The rooster's crow,
you can do it even better!

243
00:21:39,381 --> 00:21:42,771
Alright, now I'll try to do it
a bit better! Let's see...

244
00:21:44,021 --> 00:21:46,581
- I did it!
- Still, it doesn't convince me!

245
00:21:46,621 --> 00:21:48,532
There are still stars in the sky.

246
00:21:48,701 --> 00:21:50,453
This rooster suffers from insomnia!

247
00:21:50,501 --> 00:21:53,573
Damned beast, it's still night!
Cut it out!

248
00:21:55,901 --> 00:21:59,018
I'm falling!

249
00:22:00,861 --> 00:22:03,898
What the dev...! It's an angel! Help!

250
00:22:03,941 --> 00:22:06,171
An angel on me! Help!

251
00:22:06,221 --> 00:22:08,257
Get him off me! Help!

252
00:22:08,301 --> 00:22:11,179
An angel has latched onto me!
I can't shake him off!

253
00:22:11,221 --> 00:22:12,859
He's going to kill me!

254
00:22:14,701 --> 00:22:17,169
Father, give him that sphere right now!
Hurry up!

255
00:22:17,221 --> 00:22:20,019
I'll give it to you, poisonous angel!
Just go away!

256
00:22:23,581 --> 00:22:27,256
- Sapphire! - He almost drowned
to get the magic sphere!

257
00:22:27,741 --> 00:22:30,778
Sapphire, wake up!
Sapphire, it's me: Tink!

258
00:22:35,821 --> 00:22:38,733
- And what are you doing here?
- Help me! I can't swim!

259
00:22:38,781 --> 00:22:41,614
- The sphere is at the bottom of the lake!
- I'm going to get it now!

260
00:22:48,301 --> 00:22:50,690
We must expose it
to the rising morning sun,

261
00:22:50,741 --> 00:22:52,811
thus the swan's spell
will be broken.

262
00:22:52,861 --> 00:22:56,137
Look, the sun is about to rise!
Right in that direction!

263
00:23:30,861 --> 00:23:33,739
What a miracle!
But it's Mary!

264
00:23:33,781 --> 00:23:36,454
- My little girl! Mary!
- Dear Papa!

265
00:23:36,501 --> 00:23:38,537
- My daughter!
- Papa!

266
00:23:51,501 --> 00:23:54,220
Look, Tink:
there is another swan flying!

267
00:23:54,261 --> 00:23:57,731
Yes, I see it, but... That is
Hecate, the daughter of Mephisto!

268
00:24:01,021 --> 00:24:03,012
I wonder why she is accompanying us...

269
00:24:03,061 --> 00:24:05,734
I think she would gladly make
friends with us,

270
00:24:05,781 --> 00:24:08,579
if she could forget
whose daughter she is.

271
00:24:34,620 --> 00:24:38,240
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

272
00:24:38,241 --> 00:24:41,601
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

273
00:24:41,602 --> 00:24:45,372
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

274
00:24:45,373 --> 00:24:48,534
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

275
00:24:48,535 --> 00:24:52,348
♪ Sen'nen man'nen hyakuman-nen ♪
A thousand years, ten thousand years, a million years,

276
00:24:52,349 --> 00:24:55,645
♪ Ribbon de tsunagou ichioku-nen ♪
Let’s connect with ribbons for a billion years!

277
00:24:55,646 --> 00:24:59,651
♪ Akuma ga kute mo arashi ga kute mo ♪
Even if devils come, even if storms arrive,

278
00:24:59,652 --> 00:25:03,090
♪ tsunaida kokoro wa hanarenai ♪
Our bonded hearts will never part.

279
